[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Followed!</h2>
<i>"Look, a Cloud!"<br>
--The famous words of Nefen the quick to avoid his execution.</i>  
<p>The Elemental clan has sent their scouts after you!  They have already send a message to the leaders of the Elemental clan about where you currently are.  You must defeat them quickly and brace for the Elemental's attack, which is sure to come.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
The scouts are dead!  Now for the battle against the elementals...

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron41

[ai6TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Governer of Sun</h2>
<p>
I need some help here!

[ai6PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
We cannot let them kill him...

[ai6PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Governer</h2>
<p>
Without the support of the Governor of Sun's army, you were defeated by the Elemental Clan.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai7TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Help!!

[ai7PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Squire of Rain</h2>
<p>
We must save him!


[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Knight of Wind has died!</h2>
<p>
After an intense battle, the Elemental Clan finnaly defeated you after your power reserves ran dry.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai8TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Squire of Rain</h2>
<p>
My defences are failing!

[ai8PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
I hope you have a plan to save him....

[ai8PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Squire of Rain has Died!</h2>
<p>
After retreating again, the Elemental Clan followed.  Running low on storm power you were forced to stop and fight them.  The battle did not bold well, you were easily defeated.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You have failed to avenge the Duke of Thunder and you have perished also.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]


